---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const lastUpdated = "September 8, 2026";
---
<BaseLayout
	title="Privacy Policy | BlogToolStack"
	description="What data BlogToolStack collects, how it's used, and how affiliate links and analytics work on this site."
>
	<div class="content-page">
		<h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
		<p>Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>
		<p>
			This policy explains what information BlogToolStack ("this site", "we") collects from
			visitors, how it's used, and the choices you have. We keep data collection to what's
			needed to run the site and understand which content is useful.
		</p>

		<h2>Analytics</h2>
		<p>
			We use Cloudflare Web Analytics to see aggregate traffic, such as which pages are read and
			roughly how much traffic the site gets. This analytics is cookieless and does not use any
			persistent identifier to track you across sites or visits. No personal data is collected
			for analytics purposes.
		</p>

		<h2>Email sign-ups</h2>
		<p>
			If you sign up for a lead magnet or newsletter on this site, your email address is
			collected and stored by Kit (formerly ConvertKit), our email service provider, so we can
			send you the content you signed up for. You can unsubscribe at any time using the link in
			any email you receive. We don't sell or share your email address with third parties
			outside of what's needed to operate the email list.
		</p>

		<h2>Affiliate links</h2>
		<p>
			Some links on this site are affiliate links, meaning we may earn a commission if you sign
			up for a product through them, at no extra cost to you. Articles that include affiliate
			links disclose this directly in the text. Clicking an affiliate link may set a cookie on
			the destination site (for example, Kit's affiliate platform) so that a referral can be
			credited to us; that cookie is set and controlled by the destination site, not by
			BlogToolStack.
		</p>

		<h2>Third-party services</h2>
		<p>
			This site is hosted on Cloudflare and uses Kit for email delivery and affiliate tracking.
			Each of these providers has its own privacy practices governing data they process on our
			behalf.
		</p>

		<h2>Your choices</h2>
		<p>
			You can browse this site without providing any personal information. If you've subscribed
			to our email list, you can unsubscribe at any time via the link included in every email.
		</p>

		<h2>Contact</h2>
		<p>
			Questions about this policy or your data can be sent through the <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>.
		</p>
	</div>
</BaseLayout>
